Notes for future me:

- Activate the ikea_env virtual environment using the command ```source ikea_env/bin/activate```
- The .env file includes the token and hub IP address, these should not be shared at all
- Plug something into my P1 smart plug and run ```python outlets_test.py```
- Run ```python list_sensors.py``` to see the current sensors and set of temp / RH / CO2 / PM2.5 readings
